WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The photograph has hung in Rosa's hallway for sixty years.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Everyone who walks past says the same thing: what a beautiful day.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Rosa: It rained all morning. The photographer made us stand in the doorway so no one would see.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[A clock ticks. Rosa shifts in her chair.]

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Rosa: My sister was not there. That is the part the picture could not show.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Tonight, for the first time, Rosa tells her grandchildren who was missing.
